@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Register (201 on success, 409 if the email already exists)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "Password1",
  "confirmPassword": "Password1"
}

### Register with a weak password (should be 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "abc",
  "confirmPassword": "abc"
}

### Login (200 and a token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test.user@example.com", "password": "Password1" }

### Wrong password (should be 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test.user@example.com", "password": "WrongPassword1" }

### Current user (needs the token from the login request above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Current user without a token (should be 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### Save a post (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "question",
  "plan": "free",
  "title": "How do React hooks work?",
  "description": "I am confused about when useEffect runs, can someone explain?",
  "tags": ["react", "hooks"]
}

### Save a post without a plan (should be 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "question",
  "title": "How do React hooks work?",
  "description": "I am confused about when useEffect runs, can someone explain?",
  "tags": ["react"]
}

### Save a post without logging in (should be 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "question", "plan": "free", "title": "Hello there", "description": "A question that is long enough", "tags": ["react"] }

### Browse posts as a visitor (Free posts only, viewer.plan = visitor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts

### Browse posts when logged in (Free user: Free posts only. Paid user: everything)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### One whole post (replace POST_ID with an id from the list. Paid posts give 403 unless you are Paid)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/POST_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Upgrade plan with the demo test card (200, or 409 if already Paid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plan/upgrade
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "billingCycle": "monthly",
  "card": {
    "name": "Test User",
    "number": "4242 4242 4242 4242",
    "expiry": "12/30",
    "cvc": "123"
  }
}

### Upgrade with an invalid card number (should be 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plan/upgrade
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "billingCycle": "monthly",
  "card": { "name": "Test User", "number": "1234 5678 9012 3456", "expiry": "12/30", "cvc": "123" }
}

### Subscribe to the newsletter (sends a real email, use your own address)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "your-email@example.com" }
